Stack: Python with uv. Create the manifest first with `uv init`, then
`uv add --dev pytest ruff`, and keep pytest and ruff configured in `pyproject.toml`.
CI's `uv run pytest` exits 5 when no tests are collected, so add the first test
before expecting CI to go green.

```
uv sync                                   # install dependencies into .venv
uv run python -m <package>                # run locally
uv run pytest                             # full test suite
uv run pytest tests/test_x.py::test_name  # one test
uv run ruff check .                       # lint
uv run ruff format .                      # format
```
